id: pm-rust-closeout-changelog
title: Regenerate changelogs after gated sync and closeout
description: Share the pinned changelog wrapper between npm callers and just recipes so tracker changes produce a current changelog without requiring just on reusable workflow runners.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-rust#90"
created_at: "2026-10-23T14:45:42.717Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-24T21:48:10.574Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-24T21:48:10.563Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-24T21:48:10.563Z"
author: codex-agent
resolution: Gated sync and closeout invoke the repository changelog command after tracker mutations so generated release notes stay consistent.
expected_result: Share the pinned changelog wrapper between npm callers and just recipes so tracker changes produce a current changelog without requiring just on reusable workflow runners.
actual_result: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rust/pull/111, merged 2026-10-23T16:00:21Z, merge 300eaa9a9d06f0e2cfc6afcfa8b66492a960a77b: Gated sync and closeout invoke the repository changelog command after tracker mutations so generated release notes stay consistent."
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T14:46:20.181Z",codex-agent,"The sync and closeout callers disable post-change generation. Both will call the oracle changelog:full npm script, backed by the same Node wrapper used by just. Pins and dates remain literal justfile constants; release overrides remain supported."
  "2026-10-23T14:53:19.597Z",codex-agent,"The real scratch-copy acceptance passed: create and close a synthetic item, regenerate through npm from tests/oracle, assert the item appears, and verify through --check. Removing only the npm script reproduces the original Missing script failure. The initial linked run overlapped this deliberate revert and the Rust cold build exceeded the default timeout; rerunning serially with an explicit timeout."
  "2026-10-23T14:58:54.073Z",codex-agent,"Final linked verification passes with an explicit 2400-second limit: the scratch closeout acceptance passes 1/1 and release_pipeline_contract passes 19/19, with no ignored tests. The npm --check equivalent also passes. The fixture pins PM_PATH to its cloned tracker so linked-test context cannot redirect its mutations. Revert proof: removing only changelog:full causes the acceptance to fail with Missing script. Broader release gates will be verified by PR CI."
  "2026-10-23T15:05:15.795Z",codex-agent,"Added the required plain-tracker refusal at the wrapper boundary. Final linked tests pass: 2 Node acceptance tests plus 19 release-pipeline contract tests, zero failures or ignored tests. The no-git test creates a real tracker with pm init, sets GIT_CEILING_DIRECTORIES, and also removes Git from PATH. A disposable copy with only the prerequisite guard removed fails that regression with the original generic git rev-parse diagnostic. The closeout acceptance and npm-script-only revert proof remain valid."
